{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"Cindy.Cindy","latestVersion":"0.1.136","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.ee7a7da3.png","priority":1,"sha256":"ee7a7da3d3630ca761074d163b53b10f073aff7ce375e76a9affc8a18e1ba3a9","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"author":"XD Inc.","description":"An open-source AI agent that works out of the box. Consider it done.","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"author":"XD Inc.","description":"An open-source AI agent that works out of the box. Consider it done.","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Cindy is an open-source AI agent that works out of the box. She brings multiple harnesses, models, and tools into one agent that finishes real work in your projects and apps. Ready from day one, yours to shape over time.\nCindy runs locally on your own machine, using your real files and logged-in apps. The first supported harnesses are Claude Code and Codex, with more being added. Models and harnesses mix freely and can switch mid-task while your workspace, memory, skills, and tools stay continuous; one task can even be planned, executed in parallel, and reviewed by agents on different harness and model combinations.","name":"Cindy","packageUrl":"https://cindy.app/","privacyUrl":"https://protocol.xd.com/cindy/privacy.html","publisher":"XD Inc.","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/issues","publisherUrl":"https://www.xd.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/releases/tag/v0.1.38","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","large-language-model","llm"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"一个开源、开箱即用的 AI Agent：想到，就能做到。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Cindy 是一个开源、开箱即用的 AI Agent。她把多套 Harness、模型和工具收进同一个持续成长的伙伴，在真实工程和软件里把任务做完。一开始就好用，任你打扮，任你培养。\nCindy 运行在你自己的电脑上，使用你本地的文件和已登录的应用。首批兼容 Claude Code 与 Codex 两套 Agent Harness，更多 Harness 正在接入。模型与 Harness 自由组合、同一任务中随时切换，工作现场、记忆、Skill 和工具始终连续；一个任务还可以由不同 Harness 与模型组合的多个 agent 规划、并行执行、独立 review。","releaseNotes":"Desktop release 0.1.136\n更新说明\n🤖 模型组：把多个模型排成一条路线\n新增模型组设置：把已连接的模型合成一条路线，按额度、顺序或轮次自动挑选；路线还能跨电脑和共享供应商取用。任务会用一句话说明这次选了哪个来源、为什么。 @zqchris\n👥 带项目的伙伴群聊\n群可以绑定一个项目，伙伴在群里开出的任务、@ 唤醒与任务卡都落到这里，任务结果也会回到群里。群里的 Cindy 会标明替谁说话；伙伴文案统一为「伙伴」。 @DavidShenXD @nanaco666 @zqchris\n🐙 GitHub 事件自动触发任务\n连接 GitHub 后，所选仓库的事件可以直接触发自动化任务，关注的 PR 会随事件自动刷新；PR 悬浮卡片支持复制链接，手机任务菜单也能查看关联 PR。 @dashhuang @zqchris\n🧩 插件界面更完整\n插件现在可以扩展导航、任务菜单、输入补全和统一设置，并处理附件、折叠侧栏与标题栏按钮；MCP Apps 的卡片界面能按账号保存自己的页面状态，插件市场与统计读取也更轻快。 @GaoWeiLiuXD @fmfsaisai\n🎨 主题创建器与完整外观包\n新增主题创建器，可导入、编辑并分享完整的 v2 外观包，主题默认值与手动覆盖更清楚，切换后能精确恢复。输入框高度、复选框、动效和颜色也按设计规范统一。 @GaoWeiLiuXD @kirozeng\n🧭 首次登录开始引导\n首次登录或进入本机模式后会显示一次开始引导，串联迁移助理、连接模型与本机导入。设置里的迁移助理入口下移，并新增「开始引导」入口。 @dashhuang\n🖥️ 远程连接与桌面稳定性\nAgent-Net 支持在电脑间切换连接方式；断网启动不再等待环境下载，SSH 任务跳过本机环境检查。Windows 侧栏闪烁、休眠后误报崩溃、远程桌面首次查询卡住等问题也已修复。 @DavidShenXD @MagicLizi @dashhuang @xuzini-xzn @zqchris\n📱 手机角标与提问卡片\n手机图标可按待处理任务数显示角标，后台推送和账号汇总会同步更新。提问卡片会先让你看清题目再弹键盘，并尽量给出可点选项；分栏拖动、伙伴近况和插件卡片预览也更顺手。 @dashhuang @zqchris\n💳 账号切换与额度更可靠\n订阅账号在本机、远程任务和供应商组内都能按规则自动换号，暂停的账号不会再被选中，每个账号的额度和套餐标签各自独立。借用远程供应商时模型列表会正确刷新，Claude 也能看到每个账号的登录到期时间。 @DavidShenXD @GaoWeiLiuXD @MagicLizi @dashhuang @xuzini-xzn\n🧠 更多模型与工具结果兼容\nClaude 登录续期更稳，Fable 5.2 同步到离线模型目录；Grok、Claude Code 与 DeepSeek 的工具图片和历史能正确保留，自定义模型容量与大陆 Gemini 线路已补齐。 @DavidShenXD @dashhuang @fmfsaisai @xuzini-xzn\n🎬 媒体播放与语音输入\n图片和视频可以更稳定地内联播放，远程视频走文件通道传输，拖动进度、切换页面和保存图片都更可靠。语音输入在润色卡住时会保留原来的文字，不再丢失内容。 @DavidShenXD @zqchris\nPRs\n#8979 #9310 #9378 #9547 #9656 #9683 #9817 #9983 #9987 #9989 #9990 #10004 #10019 #10028 #10049 #10067 #10069 #10070 #10072 #10073 #10082 #10087 #10089 #10095 #10100 #10106 #10107 #10109 #10120 #10126 #10131 #10138 #10140 #10141 #10144 #10146 #10149 #10151 #10152 #10153 #10155 #10162 #10163 #10168 #10171 #10184 #10188 #10204 #10208 #10228\n\n- commit: 7227e8311a2d782f399323b21483c072fb1353b8\n- source tag: beta2026-11-13_10-54-29\n- regions: cn global\n- iOS(cn):整包 0.1.24(2026110601) · 热更 ae8bec7a\n- Android(cn):整包 0.1.38(51) · 热更 ad723069\n- iOS(global):整包 0.1.24(2026110601) · 热更 65cdcf88\n- Android(global):整包 0.1.38(46) · 热更 813cf111","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/releases/tag/v0.1.136","tags":["人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","自主智能"]}},"longDescription":"Cindy is an open-source AI agent that works out of the box. She brings multiple harnesses, models, and tools into one agent that finishes real work in your projects and apps. Ready from day one, yours to shape over time.\nCindy runs locally on your own machine, using your real files and logged-in apps. The first supported harnesses are Claude Code and Codex, with more being added. Models and harnesses mix freely and can switch mid-task while your workspace, memory, skills, and tools stay continuous; one task can even be planned, executed in parallel, and reviewed by agents on different harness and model combinations.","name":"Cindy","packageUrl":"https://cindy.app/","privacyUrl":"https://protocol.xd.com/cindy/privacy.html","publisher":"XD Inc.","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/issues","publisherUrl":"https://www.xd.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/releases/tag/v0.1.38","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","large-language-model","llm"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.136/app.json","detailSha256":"b835a831f3ff97fa106c0294946a94383328a7a27501137f055099f27b0e960e","releaseDate":"2026-11-13","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"0.1.136"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.135/app.json","detailSha256":"d18fcdcddf0358b7ed5fa8837b2ddf8b0f30dab3e9000cddc013d653983f548b","releaseDate":"2026-11-12","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"0.1.135"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.133/app.json","detailSha256":"5042d501eff2571e5098a878b70bffb2281bbc1677d173e85b064770243fc39f",